  "claim_boundary": "This development-only scanner is explicitly transductive: the source-v4 public plan was already embedded for the development reader and was previously inspected with theta0 v1, while theta0 v2 was trained on already-used source-v3. It reads only the admitted source-v4 public plan plus immutable reader and theta artifacts. Every root is restored only to its post-onboarding public state; decision 0 is the sole dynamically reachable first preaction, decisions 1-7 are collection stress probes, and decisions 8-47 are evaluation stress probes rather than campaign prestates. It invokes the actual typed executor under APPLY_CANDIDATE for all 5,376 probes but never opens source-v4 sealed files, settles an environment, creates PE or credit, updates the gate, runs a model, or invokes CUDA. The first canonical temporal-delivered nonnoop in the reachable and evaluation categories is paired with FORCE_STRICT_NOOP to prove actual-action divergence while the cold checkpoint remains 0/0/0. PASS only authorizes freezing a separate collection-only eight-decision dynamic protocol whose first-preaction projection must exact-match this scan; collection-prefix execution remains unauthorized until that new preregistration independently closes its gates. It does not authorize the forty-decision evaluation, a campaign effect estimate, reader qualification, Learnable, Steerable, any four-able effect, human evidence, or production ACTIVE."
